    "Name": "Gerrida A",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Gerrida hovertank is centered around a HAG-30 with a coaxially mounted ER Large Laser in its turret, which makes it excel at extreme-range combat and anti-air fire support. A Light Active Probe helps it find its targets. Like every Gerrida, it relies on an XXL engine and Vehicular Endo Steel to maximize its payload, which makes it expensive enough to be reserved for elite crews.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Lamellor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       225     70\n<b>Left</b>         180     70\n<b>Right</b>       180     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      935    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Distracting</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
